@base = http://localhost:8080

### Deployment information
GET {{base}}/api/info

### Create a product (change the SKU if running twice)
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"KEYBOARD-001","name":"Keyboard","price":29.90,"stock":10}

### List products; use the returned ID below
GET {{base}}/api/products

### Get product (replace 1 with your product ID)
GET {{base}}/api/products/1

### Replenish stock
POST {{base}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":5}

### Place order
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"productId":1,"quantity":2}]}

### List orders
GET {{base}}/api/orders

### Cancel order (replace 1 with your order ID)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1/cancel

### Insufficient stock: expect HTTP 409
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"productId":1,"quantity":9999}]}

### Readiness
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/actuator/health/liveness

### Metrics
GET {{base}}/actuator/prometheus
